### Payment Module Demo - HTTP Requests

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Create Stripe Payment Intent
POST http://localhost:3000/api/payment/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gateway": "stripe",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "description": "Demo payment via Stripe",
  "successUrl": "http://localhost:3000/payment/success",
  "cancelUrl": "http://localhost:3000/payment/cancel",
  "orderReference": "ORDER-12345",
  "customerId": "customer@example.com",
  "metadata": {
    "orderId": "12345",
    "customerEmail": "customer@example.com"
  }
}

### Create Mollie Payment Intent
POST http://localhost:3000/api/payment/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gateway": "mollie",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "description": "Demo payment via Mollie",
  "returnUrl": "http://localhost:3000/payment/success",
  "orderReference": "ORDER-67890",
  "customerId": "customer@example.com",
  "metadata": {
    "orderId": "67890",
    "customerEmail": "customer@example.com"
  }
}

### Get All Payments
GET http://localhost:3000/api/payment/all

### Get Payments by Gateway (Stripe)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/payment/all?gateway=stripe

### Get Payments by Gateway (Mollie)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/payment/all?gateway=mollie

### Get Payment by ID (Replace PAYMENT_ID with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/payment/PAYMENT_ID

### Get Payment Status (Replace PAYMENT_ID with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/payment/PAYMENT_ID/status?gateway=stripe

### Verify Payment - Frontend Callback (Replace PAYMENT_ID with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/payment/PAYMENT_ID/verify?gateway=stripe

### Process Refund (Replace PAYMENT_ID with actual ID)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/payment/PAYMENT_ID/refund
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gateway": "stripe",
  "amount": 25.00,
  "reason": "requested_by_customer"
}

### Process Full Refund (Replace PAYMENT_ID with actual ID)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/payment/PAYMENT_ID/refund
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gateway": "stripe",
  "reason": "requested_by_customer"
}

